# A squat rack, three tiles wide: two steel uprights with a loaded barbell
# resting on the J-hooks, and bumper plates stacked on the base pegs. The
# lifter stands in front of the middle tile facing it.
sprite gym-rack
size 48 40
layer object
footprint 3 1
origin 0 24
tag rack weights exercise gym
spot lift 1 1 up exercise stand

frame default
